load @/code/structure/manifold
  find manifold

# The dodecagrid, the regular honeycomb {5, 3, 4}, hyperbolic three-space tiled by right-angled dodecahedra, four around
# each edge. It is the three-dimensional analogue of the pentagrid, and the splitting method extends to it (though its
# navigation language is no longer regular, becoming non-context-free). The dodecagrid hosts a weakly universal cellular
# automaton in three dimensions. The form carries the underlying hyperbolic manifold.
form dodecagrid
  link space, like manifold
